Method 1

\begin{tabular}[t]{|l|l|} \hline \(\sin \theta=0\)  \(\frac{1}{2}\) mark for \(\sin \theta=0\) \\ \hline \(\theta=0, \pi, 2 \pi\)  \(\frac{1}{2}\) mark for any non-permissible value of \(\theta\) \\ \hline \(\theta=\pi k, k \in \mathbb{Z}\)  1 mark for all non-permissible values of \(\theta\) \\ \hline \end{tabular}

2 marks

Method 2

\begin{tabular}[t]{|l|l|} \hline \(\sin \theta=0\)  \(\frac{1}{2}\) mark for \(\sin \theta=0\) \\ \hline \(\theta=0, \pi, 2 \pi\)  \(\frac{1}{2}\) mark for any non-permissible value of \(\theta\) \\ \hline \(\left.\begin{array}{l}\theta=2 \pi k, k \in \mathbb{Z} \\ \theta=\pi+2 \pi k, k \in \mathbb{Z}\end{array}\right\}\)  1 mark for all non-permissible values of \(\theta\) \\ \hline  2 marks \\ \hline \end{tabular}

